  "content": {
    "title": "中心党总支组织开展“坚持党建引领 助力乡村振兴”主题党日",
    "source": "中心党总支",
    "publishDate": "2021-11-05",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 按照党中央和省委关于巩固拓展脱贫攻坚成果、全面推进乡村振兴安排部署，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">为</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">深入落实</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">省委省教育厅</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">抓党建促乡村振兴工作要求，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">吉林省高等学校毕业生就业指导中心党总支继</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">包保帮扶双辽市农林村和图们市上龙城村</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">两户贫困户脱贫之后</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">，持续发挥结对包保帮扶作用和优势，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">组织全体党员</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">组织开展</span>“坚持党建引领 助力乡村振兴”主题党日活动。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"307\" src=\"assets/c067a76396a17ee26b0f2d068d3a754ad3dca8fbf15cf9693698f3d5f4ed0154.jpg\" width=\"409\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 2021年10月22日上午，中心党总支记唐洪丰同志、支部书记李凌红书记、</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">支部</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">纪检委员苗立海同志和宾馆支部魏清巍同志</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">一行四</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">人</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">为代表，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">前往双辽市茂林镇农林村，对马凤奎、高发</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">两</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">户帮扶对象进行走访慰问，了解生活实际，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">给他们送去了就业中心</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">全体党员捐款</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">和慰问关怀。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"370\" src=\"assets/2b15f176e60c2ace4cc722ee7c92b963688a852849c4904192ee138ca26b2592.jpg\" width=\"493\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">&nbsp; &nbsp; 这次党日活动是中心党总支</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">“坚持党建引领 助力乡村振兴”</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">的一项举措，</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">“坚持党建引领 助力乡村振兴”</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:14.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\"><span style=\"font-family:仿宋\">意义重大，体现了我们党和政府对人民的关怀，是全面实现乡村振兴，实现中华民族伟大复兴的一项重大任务，今后我们还要探索更多更有效的方式持续做好这项工作，为吉林省的经济振兴发挥作用。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n                ",
